title: Payers › Process › Re-learn from decisions
route: /payers/summit?tab=process
intro: Historian looks at how the payer has ruled over the last 90 days and may propose one more condition for the workflow. It never edits the workflow itself. A person accepts or dismisses the proposal on the Changes tab.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Re-learn from decisions'\non the workflow card"
process busy "Button shows a spinner"
toast st "Historian is reviewing how Summit\nruled over the last 90 days."
agent h1 "Historian reviews the last 90 days\n(demo: about 3 seconds, scripted)"
decision lv "Is the person still on Payers\nwhen the 3 seconds end?"
endx dropped "Result dropped\nNo toast, no proposal"
decision nx "Is there a proposal not yet in\nthe workflow, the proposals or the dismissed list?"
toast tn "'Nothing new to propose'\nThe workflow already matches how Summit ruled in the last 90 days."
store pr "Proposal added to the payer"
toast tp "'Historian has a proposal'\nReview it on the Changes tab. The workflow has not changed."
screen bn "Process tab banner\n'Historian proposed 1 change'\nIt never edits the workflow on its own."
process badge "'Changes' tab badge goes up by one\nList dot and sidebar badge do not change"
click rv "Click 'Review in Changes'"
screen cp "Changes tab, proposal card\nHistorian chip: 'Proposal: Ask for a therapy note on continued stays'\nUnder 'Gather the documents': If request is a continued-stay request, File step"
click ca "Click 'Accept proposal'"
click cd "Click 'Dismiss'"
store ac "Condition added under that step\nWorkflow becomes the next version\nProposal removed"
store lg "Edit log entry, area 'Workflow'\nReason 'Accepted Historian's proposal: ...'"
store un "'Edits waiting' count goes up by one"
toast ta "'Proposal accepted'\nAdded under 'Gather the documents' and logged as version 8."
store dm "Proposal removed and remembered as dismissed\nHistorian will not offer it again"
toast td "'Proposal dismissed'\nThe workflow did not change."
process nr "No reason asked, no confirmation\nNo way to bring a dismissed proposal back"
end e1 "Run 'Re-learn' again for the next proposal\nSummit has two; Beacon has none left to offer"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Edits waiting › Update drafts"
goto g2 "Continues in: Payers › Edit log"

s1 --> busy --> st --> h1 --> lv
lv -->|No| dropped
lv -->|Yes| nx
nx -->|No| tn --> e1
nx -->|Yes| pr --> tp --> bn --> badge
bn --> rv --> cp
cp --> ca --> ac --> lg --> un --> ta --> g1
lg -.-> g2
cp --> cd --> dm --> td --> e1
ca -.-> nr
cd -.-> nr
ta --> e1
